sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant Router as FastAPI Router
    participant Sec as legacy_identity
    participant Svc as RequirementService
    participant FS as Filesystem

    Client->>Router: POST /api/requirements (multipart file)
    Router->>Sec: Validate Authorization header
    Sec-->>Router: Identity(username, role)
    Router->>Svc: upload_requirement(file, identity)
    Svc->>Svc: read uploaded content
    Svc->>FS: write bytes to upload_dir/filename
    FS-->>Svc: file stored
    Svc-->>Router: RequirementUploadResponse
    Router-->>Client: 201 Created + upload metadata
